{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_executes": {
        "evelynn_ult": "【附加包】就绪后等她连续打中英雄或被围时释放：前方扇形<#a974ffff>150<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>75%<><#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>，对生命不高于<#ffb900ff>30%<>的目标×2.4，期间<#ef5350ff>不可选中<>并向后闪，随后很快重回魅影。",
        "akali_ult": "【附加包】穿过目标英雄，路径上的敌人受到<#a974ffff>140<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% 法术强度<>的<#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>；<#ffb900ff>2.5秒<>后再穿过它（死了或跑远就换附近的英雄），<#a974ffff>86<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>43%<>，按目标已损失生命最多+<#ffb900ff>200%<>。<#ff9028ff>连招 R E E R<>：两段之间隼舞二段落到英雄身上，立刻放第二段。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_executes": {
        "evelynn_ult": "【附加包】就緒後待她連續擊中英雄或被包圍時施放：前方扇形<#a974ffff>150<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>75%<><#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>，對生命不高於<#ffb900ff>30%<>的目標×2.4，期間<#ef5350ff>無法被選取<>並向後閃，隨後很快重回魔魅之影。",
        "akali_ult": "【附加包】穿過目標英雄，路徑上的敵人受到<#a974ffff>140<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% 魔法強度<>的<#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>；<#ffb900ff>2.5秒<>後再穿過它（死了或跑遠就換附近的英雄），<#a974ffff>86<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>43%<>，按目標已損失生命最多+<#ffb900ff>200%<>。<#ff9028ff>連招 R E E R<>：兩段之間離群手裡劍第二段命中英雄，立刻放第二段。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_executes": {
        "evelynn_ult": "[Add-on] Readied, cast once she has hit champions a few times or is surrounded: a cone of <#a974ffff>150<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>75%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, x2.4 on targets at <#ffb900ff>30%<> health or below; she is <#ef5350ff>untargetable<>, warps back and soon returns to the Shade.",
        "akali_ult": "[Add-on] Akali dashes through the target champion: <#a974ffff>140<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies in her path. <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> later she dashes through it again (or a nearby champion) for <#a974ffff>86<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>43% AP<>, up to +<#ffb900ff>200%<> by missing health. <#ff9028ff>Combo R E E R<>: Shuriken Flip's dash landing on a champion in between fires the second dash at once."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_executes": {
        "evelynn_ult": "[확장] 준비된 뒤 챔피언을 여러 번 맞히거나 포위되면 시전: 전방 부채꼴에 <#a974ffff>150<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>75%<>의 <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>, 체력 <#ffb900ff>30%<> 이하 대상에게 x2.4. <#ef5350ff>대상으로 지정 불가<> 상태로 뒤로 순간이동하고 곧 장막에 들어갑니다.",
        "akali_ult": "[확장] 대상 챔피언을 관통해 경로의 적에게 <#a974ffff>140<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>주문력의 70%<> <#a974ffff>마법 피해<>. <#ffb900ff>2.5초<> 뒤 다시 관통해(없으면 근처 챔피언) <#a974ffff>86<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>주문력의 43%<>, 대상의 잃은 체력에 비례해 최대 +<#ffb900ff>200%<>. <#ff9028ff>연계 R E E R<>: 그 사이 표창곡예 두 번째 돌진이 챔피언에게 닿으면 바로 두 번째 돌진."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_executes": {
        "evelynn_ult": "【拡張】準備後、チャンピオンに何度か当てるか囲まれると発動：前方扇形に<#a974ffff>150<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>75%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>、体力<#ffb900ff>30%<>以下の対象にはx2.4。<#ef5350ff>対象指定不可<>で後方へ移動し、すぐ影に戻る。",
        "akali_ult": "【拡張】対象を突き抜け、通過した敵に<#a974ffff>140<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>魔力の70%<>の<#a974ffff>魔法ダメージ<>。<#ffb900ff>2.5秒<>後に再び突き抜け（いなければ近くの別のチャンピオン）<#a974ffff>86<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>魔力の43%<>、対象の減少体力に応じて最大+<#ffb900ff>200%<>。<#ff9028ff>コンボ R E E R<>：その間に翻身手裏剣の2段目が当たるとすぐ2段目。"
      }
    }
  }
}
